We computer geeks sometimes like to overthink problems, don't we?  :)

Obtain some appropriate sided dice.

On a piece of paper, assign numbers to each class, gender, alignment, etc.

Before starting the game, roll for your attributes.  Come up with a name
based on that.

Star nethack.  Put in your name.  Choose the choices that correspond to
your die rolls.

